Per-file costs on this APFS volume: `lstat` about 0.005 ms, empty-file create about 0.1–0.15 ms, and `os.link` about 0.4 ms. Hardlinking unchanged files therefore costs more per file than the lstat check, and the incremental path is metadata-bound. I'll repeat each measurement to get stable medians before using them in the budget.
